{"4356360": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Breakaway Hockey League", "steam_appid": 4356360, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356360/extras/cac63ff0c10afdfaa8357f732fd017a9.avif?t=1787772364\" width=1080 height=78 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356360/extras/c560123bf8521b781f21dd0bface87e5.poster.avif?t=1787772364\" width=1080 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356360/extras/c560123bf8521b781f21dd0bface87e5.webm?t=1787772364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356360/extras/c560123bf8521b781f21dd0bface87e5.mp4?t=1787772364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The lights are on, the crowd is roaring, the puck has dropped. Step onto the ice in fast-paced, third-person hockey where every stride, deke, pass, hit, and shot is controlled by you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No winner? Overtime. Still tied? A penalty shot showdown decides who becomes the hero. Built for relentless puck pressure and constant highlight-reel moments, Breakaway Hockey League delivers explosive breakaways, huge hits, clutch goals, and dramatic finishes where one play can change everything.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356360/extras/e5cd98b3c526bf9266c6d88635342a59.avif?t=1787772364\" width=1080 height=78 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356360/extras/82f3959f7472c5f310e883241a612e36.poster.avif?t=1787772364\" width=1080 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356360/extras/82f3959f7472c5f310e883241a612e36.webm?t=1787772364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356360/extras/82f3959f7472c5f310e883241a612e36.mp4?t=1787772364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump in with intuitive controls, then sharpen your mechanics, timing, and hockey IQ by mastering dynamic skating, precision shot aiming, purposeful passing, smart positioning, and filthy dekes as you climb a true skill-based ranked ladder where contenders become champions. Every shift can become the play everyone remembers.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356360/extras/40749a52dd48f81227a34d229bd0cd86.avif?t=1787772364\" width=1080 height=78 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356360/extras/23aa9b72d0d9ef737ce8e60cc9aaff2c.poster.avif?t=1787772364\" width=1080 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356360/extras/23aa9b72d0d9ef737ce8e60cc9aaff2c.webm?t=1787772364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356360/extras/23aa9b72d0d9ef737ce8e60cc9aaff2c.mp4?t=1787772364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explosive breakaways. Bone-crushing hits. Impossible saves. Dirty dangles and last-second snipes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breakaway Hockey League is built for nonstop action and unforgettable moments where one play can turn a rookie into a legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356360/extras/6b744f3ee5e0b29f0abd38dcbbc34f1a.avif?t=1787772364\" width=1080 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356360/extras/66ec43c94c48dbb9de7bf4f25cb89377.poster.avif?t=1787772364\" width=1080 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356360/extras/66ec43c94c48dbb9de7bf4f25cb89377.webm?t=1787772364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356360/extras/66ec43c94c48dbb9de7bf4f25cb89377.mp4?t=1787772364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of one skater in third-person. Be the playmaker, the enforcer, the goalie, and the game winner. Every cut, deke, pass, body check, and shot comes directly from your inputs and skill. Transition seamlessly between forward and backward skating, and combine precision aiming with true puck physics to outplay your opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356360/extras/7178037f83872f964b84e3adaf65fcff.avif?t=1787772364\" width=1080 height=78 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356360/extras/95b5882bc73ec4d925c30c202175d37e.poster.avif?t=1787772364\" width=1080 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356360/extras/95b5882bc73ec4d925c30c202175d37e.webm?t=1787772364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356360/extras/95b5882bc73ec4d925c30c202175d37e.mp4?t=1787772364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Queue up with your squad, build unstoppable chemistry, and battle your way through ranked seasons to prove your team belongs among the best on the ice. Create your identity through deep customization and stand out for both your style and your skill.<strong> </strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356360/extras/78f858d08b218298c4aa832d53b7c063.avif?t=1787772364\" width=1080 height=78 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356360/extras/41a946ac62e9e4178095e348046e6eca.poster.avif?t=1787772364\" width=1080 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356360/extras/41a946ac62e9e4178095e348046e6eca.webm?t=1787772364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356360/extras/41a946ac62e9e4178095e348046e6eca.mp4?t=1787772364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356360/extras/b0bd38b9abc5a1f6c67f9b26c6f0a31f.avif?t=1787772364\" width=1080 height=78 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced 4v4 Hockey</strong> - Five-minute matches built around nonstop action, quick transitions, and big moments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One Skater, Total Control</strong> - Control one skater in third-person; every stride, deke, pass, and shot is yours.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Every Role</strong> - Create plays up front, defend your zone, throw heavy hits, or take over between the pipes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Skating</strong> - Move between forward and backward skating, sharp cuts, quick bursts, with precise control.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill-Based Shooting</strong> - Place each shot with skill and beat goalies through timing, precision, and execution.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Purposeful Passing</strong> - Move the puck with smart passes, positioning, quick reads, and strong team chemistry.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>True Puck Physics</strong> - Expect rebounds, deflections, loose-puck battles, and spontaneous highlight-reel action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Big Hits &amp; Physical Play</strong> - Separate opponents from the puck with huge checks and intense defensive pressure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skillful Dekes &amp; Dangles</strong> - Beat defenders with player-controlled moves rewarding timing and clean execution.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overtime &amp; Shootouts</strong> - Tied games go to overtime, then a penalty shot showdown if no team can break through.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill-Based Ranked Play</strong> - Compete, improve, climb the ranks, and prove your squad belongs among the best.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Player Customization</strong> - Stand out on the ice with player customization options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built for Teamwork</strong> - Queue with your squad, build chemistry, and win together on ice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy to Learn, Built to Master</strong> - Intuitive controls with a deep skill ceiling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Not a Simulation - </strong>Outplay or be outplayed. Stats don't determine the outcome. You do.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">//</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>That's not all!</strong> <strong><i>More features to be announced later on.</i></strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356360/extras/cac63ff0c10afdfaa8357f732fd017a9.avif?t=1787772364\" width=1080 height=78 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356360/extras/c560123bf8521b781f21dd0bface87e5.poster.avif?t=1787772364\" width=1080 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356360/extras/c560123bf8521b781f21dd0bface87e5.webm?t=1787772364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356360/extras/c560123bf8521b781f21dd0bface87e5.mp4?t=1787772364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The lights are on, the crowd is roaring, the puck has dropped. Step onto the ice in fast-paced, third-person hockey where every stride, deke, pass, hit, and shot is controlled by you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No winner? Overtime. Still tied? A penalty shot showdown decides who becomes the hero. Built for relentless puck pressure and constant highlight-reel moments, Breakaway Hockey League delivers explosive breakaways, huge hits, clutch goals, and dramatic finishes where one play can change